    "text": "Consider an ionic solid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MX</mi></math>,&nbsp;with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaCl</mi></math> structure. Construct a new structure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;whose unit cell is constructed from the unit cell of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MX</mi></math>,&nbsp;following the sequential instructions given below. Neglect the charge balance.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Remove all the anions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;except the central one.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Replace all the face centered cations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;by anions <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Remove all the corner cations <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfenced></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iv</mi><mo>)</mo></math> Replace the central anion <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;with cation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mfenced></math>.<br />The value of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math>&nbsp;is _____."
  },
