    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>FCC</mi></math><table border=\"1\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>^</mo><mo>-</mo></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>4</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>4 &ndash; 3</td>\t\t\t<td>3 + 1</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>4 &ndash; 3 &ndash; 1</td>\t\t\t<td>3 + 1</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>1</td>\t\t\t<td>3</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>."
